/* Global browser security headers */
/* Keep inline scripts/styles and required third-party assets working for the existing site. */
/* Netlify applies these headers to all static responses. */

/* All site pages */
/* X-Content-Type-Options prevents MIME sniffing. */
/* Referrer-Policy limits cross-site referrer leakage. */
/* Permissions-Policy disables browser capabilities the site does not need. */
/* frame-ancestors is intentionally handled by X-Frame-Options for broad browser support. */
/* CSP is not added here yet because the existing site uses inline scripts/styles and TinyMCE/CDN resources; an incorrect CSP could break production. */
/* API endpoints have their own CORS/authentication logic in Netlify Functions. */

/* Netlify header syntax */
/* The following headers are intentionally conservative. */

/*
  The wildcard route is supported by Netlify's _headers file.
*/

/*
  / *
    X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
    Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
    Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
    X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  * /
*/
